Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 01:39:31 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] fix(contracts): session.events.since replay events declare
 carried_from

A turn carried to a new gateway publishes frames naming the carrier's replay_epoch and seq; the
canonical result model forbade the key, so every replay of such a frame logged a wire-contract error.
